<view class="page"><view class="navbar"><uni-icons wx:if="{{a}}" u-i="2345d4e6-0" bind:__l="__l" u-p="{{a}}"/><text class="navbar-title">值得看么</text><view class="navbar-right"><uni-icons wx:if="{{b}}" u-i="2345d4e6-1" bind:__l="__l" u-p="{{b}}"/><image class="navbar-avatar" src="{{c}}" mode="aspectFill"/></view></view><view class="tabs"><view wx:for="{{d}}" wx:for-item="tab" wx:key="c" class="{{['tab-item', tab.d && 'active']}}" bindtap="{{tab.e}}"><text class="tab-text">{{tab.a}}</text><view wx:if="{{tab.b}}" class="tab-line"/></view></view><scroll-view scroll-y class="scroll-body"><view class="card card-white"><view class="card-meta"><text class="meta-dynasty">唐朝</text><text class="meta-dot">·</text><text class="meta-type">山水</text></view><text class="card-title">静夜思</text><text class="card-body">床前明月光，疑是地上霜。举头望明月，低头思故乡。</text><view class="card-footer"><uni-icons wx:if="{{e}}" u-i="2345d4e6-2" bind:__l="__l" u-p="{{e}}"/><text class="card-more">全文阅读 →</text></view><view class="card-tag-right"><text class="tag-vert">李白之</text></view></view><view class="card card-mountain"><view class="card-meta"><text class="meta-dynasty" style="color:#fff">唐朝</text><text class="meta-dot" style="color:#fff">·</text><text class="meta-type" style="color:#fff">山水</text></view><text class="card-title" style="color:#fff">鹿柴</text><text class="card-body" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9)">空山不见人，但闻人语响。返景入深林，复照青苔上。</text><view class="card-footer"><image src="{{f}}" class="footer-avatar" mode="aspectFill"/><text class="card-label" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7)">INCLUDED IN TANG ZHI</text></view><view class="card-tag-right"><text class="tag-vert">王维之</text></view></view><view class="card card-green"><text class="card-featured-label">FEATURED SELECTION</text><text class="card-title card-title-lg" style="color:#fff">春江花月夜</text><text class="card-body" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9)">春江潮水连海平，海上明月共潮生。滟滟随波千万里，何处春江无月明！</text><view class="card-en-desc"><text class="en-text">The grandeur of a poem called "Tapestry of the Spring River, Flowers, Moon and Night"</text></view><view class="card-footer" style="margin-top:20rpx"><uni-icons wx:if="{{g}}" u-i="2345d4e6-3" bind:__l="__l" u-p="{{g}}"/><text style="color:#fff;font-size:22rpx;margin-left:8rpx">1.2k Reads</text></view><view class="card-tag-right"><text class="tag-vert">张若虚</text></view></view><view class="card card-white"><view class="card-meta"><text class="meta-dynasty">宋朝</text><text class="meta-dot">·</text><text class="meta-type">词</text></view><text class="card-title">定风波</text><text class="card-body">莫听穿林打叶声，何妨吟啸且徐行。竹杖芒鞋轻胜马，谁怕？一蓑烟雨任平生。</text><view class="card-footer"><text class="card-author">苏轼</text><text class="card-more" style="margin-left:auto">全文阅读</text></view><view class="card-tag-right"><text class="tag-vert">苏轼之</text></view></view><view class="card card-dark"><view class="card-meta"><text class="meta-dynasty" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7)">宋朝</text><text class="meta-dot" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7)">·</text><text class="meta-type" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7)">词</text></view><text class="card-title" style="color:#fff;font-size:48rpx">青玉案·元夕</text><text class="card-body" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)">众里寻他千百度，蓦然回首，那人却在，灯火阑珊处。</text><view class="card-tag-right"><text class="tag-vert">辛弃疾</text></view></view><view style="height:30rpx"/></scroll-view><view class="tabbar"><view class="tab-bar-item" bindtap="{{i}}"><uni-icons wx:if="{{h}}" u-i="2345d4e6-4" bind:__l="__l" u-p="{{h}}"/><text class="tab-bar-text">首页</text></view><view class="tab-bar-item active"><uni-icons wx:if="{{j}}" u-i="2345d4e6-5" bind:__l="__l" u-p="{{j}}"/><text class="tab-bar-text active-text">文库</text></view><view class="tab-bar-item tab-center"><view class="tab-center-btn"><uni-icons wx:if="{{k}}" u-i="2345d4e6-6" bind:__l="__l" u-p="{{k}}"/></view><text class="tab-bar-text">题习</text></view><view class="tab-bar-item"><uni-icons wx:if="{{l}}" u-i="2345d4e6-7" bind:__l="__l" u-p="{{l}}"/><t